<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>The Invisible Landscape | Active Project Hub</title>
    
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Cormorant+Garamond:ital,wght@0,300;0,400;0,500;0,600;1,400&family=Inter:wght@300;400;500;600;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">

    <style>
        /* --- HIGH-CONTRAST CREATOR DESIGN SYSTEM --- */
        :root {
            --bg-paper: #FFFFFF;     
            --ink-main: #111111;     
            --ink-muted: #555555;    
            --natgeo-yellow: #FFCC00;
            --border-heavy: #111111;
            --border-subtle: #E0E0E0;
            --accent-blue: #0044FF;
            --accent-red: #FF3333;
            
            --font-serif: 'Cormorant Garamond', Georgia, serif;
            --font-sans: 'Inter', -apple-system, sans-serif;
            
            --easing: 1.2s cubic-bezier(0.22, 1, 0.36, 1);
        }

        * { margin: 0; padding: 0; box-sizing: border-box; }
        body {
            font-family: var(--font-sans);
            color: var(--ink-main);
            background-color: var(--bg-paper);
            line-height: 1.8;
            -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;
            overflow-x: hidden;
        }

        /* TYPOGRAPHY */
        h1, h2, h3, .serif-text { font-family: var(--font-serif); font-weight: 500; }
        h1 { font-size: clamp(3rem, 6vw, 5.5rem); line-height: 1.05; letter-spacing: -0.02em; }
        h2 { font-size: clamp(2rem, 4vw, 3.5rem); line-height: 1.1; margin-bottom: 1rem; }
        h3 { font-size: 1.8rem; margin-bottom: 0.5rem; }
        p { font-size: 1.1rem; color: var(--ink-muted); margin-bottom: 2rem; font-weight: 400; line-height: 1.7; }
        .meta-label { font-family: var(--font-sans); font-size: 0.75rem; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.15em; font-weight: 700; color: var(--ink-main); margin-bottom: 1rem; display: block; }

        /* STATUS TAGS */
        .status-tag { display: inline-block; padding: 0.35rem 0.85rem; font-size: 0.7rem; font-weight: 700; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.1em; border-radius: 4px; margin-bottom: 1rem; border: 1px solid var(--ink-main); }
        .tag-ideation { background: #E0E7FF; color: #111; } 
        .tag-execution { background: var(--natgeo-yellow); color: #111; } 
        .tag-data { background: #DCFCE7; color: #111; } 
        .tag-blocker { background: #FEE2E2; color: #111; }
        .tag-dark { background: var(--ink-main); color: var(--bg-paper); }

        /* LAYOUT & STRUCTURE */
        .container { max-width: 1200px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 0 4vw; }
        .section-padding { padding: 8rem 0; }
        .divider { width: 100%; height: 2px; background-color: var(--border-heavy); margin: 5rem 0; }
        
        .text-center-wrap { max-width: 800px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; }
        .text-center-wrap p { margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; }
        .text-wrap { max-width: 550px; margin: 0 auto; }

        /* IMAGE HANDLING */
        img { width: 100%; height: 100%; object-fit: cover; display: block; filter: contrast(1.1); transition: filter 0.5s ease; }
        .img-wrap { overflow: hidden; background-color: var(--border-subtle); border: 2px solid var(--ink-main); }
        .img-landscape { aspect-ratio: 16/9; }
        .img-portrait { aspect-ratio: 3/4; }
        
        /* NAVIGATION */
        header {
            position: fixed; top: 0; width: 100%; z-index: 1000;
            background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.95);
            backdrop-filter: blur(8px);
            padding: 1.5rem 0;
            border-bottom: 2px solid var(--border-heavy);
        }
        .nav-inner { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; max-width: 1400px; }
        
        .brand-logo { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 12px; cursor: pointer; text-decoration: none; }
        .yellow-border-mark { width: 16px; height: 16px; background-color: var(--natgeo-yellow); border: 2px solid var(--ink-main); }
        .logo-text { font-family: var(--font-sans); font-size: 0.85rem; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.15em; font-weight: 700; color: var(--ink-main); }
        
        .nav-links { display: flex; gap: 2.5rem; list-style: none; }
        .nav-links li { font-size: 0.8rem; text-transform: uppercase; font-weight: 600; letter-spacing: 0.1em; color: var(--ink-muted); cursor: pointer; transition: color 0.3s ease; }
        .nav-links li:hover { color: var(--ink-main); }
        .nav-links li.active { color: var(--ink-main); text-decoration: underline; text-decoration-color: var(--natgeo-yellow); text-decoration-thickness: 3px; text-underline-offset: 6px; }

        /* SPA CONTROLLER */
        .view-section { display: none; padding-top: 80px; min-height: 100vh; opacity: 0; }
        .view-section.active { display: block; animation: smoothFadeIn var(--easing) forwards; }
        @keyframes smoothFadeIn { from { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(15px); } to { opacity: 1; transform: translateY(0); } }
        .reveal { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(30px); transition: opacity 0.8s ease, transform 0.8s ease; }
        .reveal.visible { opacity: 1; transform: translateY(0); }

        /* --- HERO SECTION --- */
        .hero { min-height: 85vh; display: flex; flex-direction: column; justify-content: center; position: relative; }
        .hero-title-wrap { max-width: 900px; margin: 0 auto 3rem; text-align: center; z-index: 2; }
        .hero-image-wrap { width: 100%; height: 55vh; position: relative; border-radius: 0; }
        .hero-statement { font-family: var(--font-serif); font-size: 1.75rem; font-style: italic; color: var(--ink-main); max-width: 750px; margin: -4rem auto 0; position: relative; z-index: 3; background: var(--bg-paper); padding: 2.5rem; text-align: center; border: 2px solid var(--border-heavy); box-shadow: 8px 8px 0px var(--natgeo-yellow); }
        
        /* --- DATA CARDS & RESOURCES (BRUTALIST STYLE) --- */
        .data-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr); gap: 2.5rem; margin-top: 4rem; }
        .data-point { background-color: var(--bg-paper); border: 2px solid var(--border-heavy); border-top: 8px solid var(--natgeo-yellow); padding: 3rem 2rem; text-align: center; box-shadow: 6px 6px 0px var(--ink-main); transition: transform 0.2s ease, box-shadow 0.2s ease; }
        .data-point:hover { transform: translate(-2px, -2px); box-shadow: 10px 10px 0px var(--ink-main); }
        .data-value { font-family: var(--font-serif); font-weight: 600; font-size: 4rem; line-height: 1; color: var(--ink-main); margin-bottom: 1rem; display: block; }
        .data-context { font-size: 0.95rem; font-weight: 500; color: var(--ink-muted); }

        /* --- RESOURCE CARDS --- */
        .resource-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 2.5rem; margin-top: 4rem; }
        .resource-card { border: 2px solid var(--border-heavy); padding: 3rem; background: var(--bg-paper); box-shadow: 6px 6px 0px var(--border-heavy); transition: transform 0.2s ease, box-shadow 0.2s ease; display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: flex-start; }
        .resource-card:hover { transform: translate(-2px, -2px); box-shadow: 10px 10px 0px var(--border-heavy); }
        .resource-card h2 { font-size: 2.2rem; margin-bottom: 1rem; }
        .resource-card p { margin-bottom: 0; }

        /* --- TEAM ROWS (BRUTALIST LIST) --- */
        .team-list { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 2.5rem; margin-top: 5rem; max-width: 1000px; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; }
        .team-row { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 220px 1fr; gap: 3rem; align-items: center; border: 2px solid var(--border-heavy); background: #FAFAFA; padding: 2rem; box-shadow: 6px 6px 0px var(--ink-main); transition: transform 0.2s ease; }
        .team-row:hover { transform: translate(-2px, -2px); box-shadow: 10px 10px 0px var(--ink-main); background: var(--bg-paper); }
        .team-photo { width: 100%; aspect-ratio: 3/4; border: 2px solid var(--border-heavy); overflow: hidden; }
        .team-photo img { filter: grayscale(100%) contrast(1.2); }
        .team-row:hover .team-photo img { filter: grayscale(0%) contrast(1.1); }
        .team-info h3 { font-size: clamp(2rem, 4vw, 2.75rem); margin-bottom: 0.5rem; }
        .team-info .meta-label { color: var(--accent-blue); margin-bottom: 1rem; }

        /* --- EDITORIAL GRIDS --- */
        .grid-split { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 6vw; align-items: center; }
        
        /* --- ACCORDION / AGENDA BLOCKS --- */
        .agenda-list { margin-top: 3rem; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 1.5rem; }
        .agenda-block { border: 2px solid var(--border-heavy); background: #FAFAFA; padding: 2rem; box-shadow: 4px 4px 0px var(--border-subtle); }
        details { margin-top: 1.5rem; }
        summary { font-family: var(--font-sans); font-weight: 700; font-size: 0.9rem; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.1em; color: var(--accent-blue); cursor: pointer; list-style: none; display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px; padding-bottom: 1rem; border-bottom: 2px dashed var(--border-subtle); outline: none; }
        summary::-webkit-details-marker { display: none; }
        summary::before { content: '+'; font-size: 1.2rem; font-weight: 400; color: var(--ink-main); }
        details[open] summary::before { content: '−'; }
        .agenda-content { padding-top: 1.5rem; font-size: 1rem; }
        .agenda-content ul { padding-left: 1.5rem; margin-bottom: 1rem; }
        .agenda-content li { margin-bottom: 0.5rem; }

        /* --- VISUAL DATA CANVAS (STRING MAPPING PROTOTYPE) --- */
        .data-canvas-wrapper { width: 100%; height: 500px; background-color: #FAFAFA; border: 2px solid var(--border-heavy); position: relative; overflow: hidden; margin-top: 2rem; box-shadow: inset 0 0 50px rgba(0,0,0,0.02); background-image: radial-gradient(#d1d1d1 1px, transparent 1px); background-size: 20px 20px; }
        
        .map-node { position: absolute; width: 16px; height: 16px; background: var(--natgeo-yellow); border: 2px solid var(--ink-main); border-radius: 50%; z-index: 10; cursor: pointer; transition: transform 0.2s; }
        .map-node:hover { transform: scale(1.5); }
        .map-node::after { content: attr(data-info); position: absolute; top: -35px; left: 50%; transform: translateX(-50%); background: var(--ink-main); color: #fff; padding: 4px 10px; font-size: 0.7rem; font-family: var(--font-sans); white-space: nowrap; border-radius: 4px; opacity: 0; transition: opacity 0.2s; pointer-events: none; font-weight: 600; }
        .map-node:hover::after { opacity: 1; }

        .svg-canvas { position: absolute; top: 0; left: 0; width: 100%; height: 100%; z-index: 1; pointer-events: none; }
        .string-path { fill: none; stroke: var(--ink-main); stroke-width: 2; stroke-dasharray: 6; animation: flow 20s linear infinite; }
        .string-hazard { stroke: var(--accent-red); stroke-width: 3; stroke-dasharray: 4; animation: flowReverse 10s linear infinite; }
        
        @keyframes flow { to { stroke-dashoffset: 1000; } }
        @keyframes flowReverse { to { stroke-dashoffset: -1000; } }

        /* BUTTONS */
        .btn { display: inline-block; padding: 1rem 2.5rem; background: var(--bg-paper); color: var(--ink-main); border: 2px solid var(--border-heavy); font-family: var(--font-sans); font-size: 0.8rem; font-weight: 700; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.15em; cursor: pointer; transition: all 0.2s ease; box-shadow: 4px 4px 0px var(--ink-main); }
        .btn:hover { transform: translate(-2px, -2px); box-shadow: 6px 6px 0px var(--ink-main); background: var(--natgeo-yellow); }

        /* RESPONSIVE */
        @media (max-width: 900px) {
            .grid-split { grid-template-columns: 1fr; flex-direction: column; }
            .data-grid, .resource-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
            .nav-links { display: none; } 
            h1 { font-size: 2.8rem; }
            .hero-statement { margin: -2rem 1rem 0; width: calc(100% - 2rem); padding: 1.5rem; }
        }
        @media (max-width: 768px) {
            .team-row { grid-template-columns: 1fr; text-align: center; gap: 1.5rem; padding: 2rem 1rem; }
            .team-photo { max-width: 240px; margin: 0 auto; }
            .team-info .meta-label { justify-content: center; }
            .resource-card { align-items: center; text-align: center; }
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

    <header>
        <div class="container nav-inner">
            <a href="#" class="brand-logo nav-trigger" data-target="home">
                <div class="yellow-border-mark"></div>
                <div class="logo-text">The Invisible Landscape</div>
            </a>
            <nav>
                <ul class="nav-links">
                    <li class="nav-item active" data-target="home">Overview</li>
                    <li class="nav-item" data-target="resources">Resources</li>
                    <li class="nav-item" data-target="team">Team</li>
                    <li class="nav-item" data-target="fieldlog">Project Hub & Logs</li>
                </ul>
            </nav>
        </div>
    </header>

    <main>
        <!-- VIEW: OVERVIEW -->
        <article id="home" class="view-section active">
            <!-- Hero Section[cite: 1] -->
            <section class="hero container reveal">
                <div class="hero-title-wrap">
                    <span class="meta-label">A Nat Geo Project</span>
                    <h1>We cannot fix what<br>we cannot see.</h1>
                </div>
                
                <div class="hero-image-wrap img-wrap">
                    <img src="live wire.png" alt="Stark landscape">
                </div>
                
                <div class="hero-statement">
                    Every monsoon, the ground beneath India’s most vulnerable communities becomes a minefield. Unmapped hazards claim thousands of lives. The system is blind. We are building the eyes.
                </div>
            </section>

            <!-- Economic Framework[cite: 1] -->
            <section class="section-padding container">
                <div class="reveal">
                    <div class="text-center-wrap">
                        <span class="meta-label">The Economics</span>
                        <h2>The Mathematics of Negligence.</h2>
                        <p>This is not just a humanitarian crisis; it is a macro-economic leak. Over <strong>40% of fatalities</strong> from civic hazards are young breadwinners. The current model waits for the system to break, pays a fraction of the cost, and absorbs a massive economic loss.</p>
                    </div>
                    
                    <div class="data-grid">
                        <div class="data-point">
                            <span class="meta-label">The Government Fix</span>
                            <span class="data-value">$9k</span>
                            <span class="data-context">₹7.5 Lakh paid in compensation after a fatal accident occurs.</span>
                        </div>
                        <div class="data-point">
                            <span class="meta-label">True Economic Loss</span>
                            <span class="data-value">$640k</span>
                            <span class="data-context">₹4.5 Crore wiped out in lost human productivity per life.</span>
                        </div>
                        <div class="data-point">
                            <span class="meta-label">The Macro Drain</span>
                            <span class="data-value">3%</span>
                            <span class="data-context">GDP lost annually to poor infrastructure and unseen road hazards.</span>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </section>

            <!-- The Insight[cite: 1] -->
            <section class="container reveal section-padding" style="padding-top: 0;">
                <div class="grid-split">
                    <div class="img-wrap img-portrait">
                        <img src="child.png" alt="Abstract earthy map texture">
                    </div>
                    <div class="text-wrap">
                        <span class="meta-label">The Strategy</span>
                        <h2>The best sensors<br>don't use batteries.</h2>
                        <p>Top-down municipal mapping fails because it relies on static surveys. But there is a demographic that walks these specific dirt paths, alleys, and kiln routes every single day. Children.</p>
                        <p>By treating migration, age, and language not as roadblocks, but as design variables, we transform marginalized youth into active, hyper-local data sensors.</p>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="divider"></div>
            </section>
        </article>

        <!-- VIEW: RESOURCES -->
        <article id="resources" class="view-section">
            <section class="section-padding container reveal">
                <div class="text-center-wrap">
                    <span class="meta-label">Methodologies</span>
                    <h1>Core Frameworks.</h1>
                    <p>The pedagogical and spatial frameworks guiding our field operations in the NCR region.</p>
                </div>
                
                <div class="resource-grid">
                    <div class="resource-card">
                        <span class="status-tag tag-data">Data Architecture</span>
                        <h2>Geographic Info Systems</h2>
                        <p>Understanding the spatial mapping foundations that allow us to translate analog string-maps into actionable digital vulnerability indexes[cite: 1].</p>
                    </div>
                    <div class="resource-card">
                        <span class="status-tag tag-ideation">Theoretical Core</span>
                        <h2>What is Mapping?</h2>
                        <p>Redefining cartography. Mapping is not just geography; it is the documentation of human movement, exposure, and environmental reality[cite: 1].</p>
                    </div>
                    <div class="resource-card">
                        <span class="status-tag tag-execution">Field Operations</span>
                        <h2>Need-Based Education</h2>
                        <p>Education designed for survival. We bypass traditional rote learning to teach practical, immediate risk calculation disguised as play[cite: 1].</p>
                    </div>
                    <div class="resource-card">
                        <span class="status-tag tag-dark">Algorithm Synthesis</span>
                        <h2>The Vulnerability Index</h2>
                        <p>The mathematical synthesis of our ground data. How we quantify hazard types against population exposure to rank community risks[cite: 1].</p>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </section>
        </article>

        <!-- VIEW: TEAM -->
        <article id="team" class="view-section">
            <section class="section-padding container reveal">
                <div class="text-center-wrap">
                    <span class="meta-label">The Ecosystem</span>
                    <h1>Specialized expertise.</h1>
                    <p>The cross-disciplinary cohort bridging environmental research, capital mechanics, and localized ground operations.</p>
                </div>
                
                <div class="team-list">
                    <!-- Priya[cite: 1] -->
                    <div class="team-row">
                        <div class="team-photo">
                            <img src="priya.png" alt="Priya">
                        </div>
                        <div class="team-info">
                            <h3>Priya</h3>
                            <span class="meta-label">Explorer | Environmental Lens</span>
                            <p>Drives the environmental research, curriculum design, and operational toolsets[cite: 1].</p>
                        </div>
                    </div>

                    <!-- Vivek[cite: 1] -->
                    <div class="team-row">
                        <div class="team-photo">
                            <img src="vivek.png" alt="Vivek">
                        </div>
                        <div class="team-info">
                            <h3>Vivek</h3>
                            <span class="meta-label">Lead Educator | Capital Lens</span>
                            <p>Contextualizes the curriculum for ground realities, focusing on the underlying economic mechanics of the sites[cite: 1].</p>
                        </div>
                    </div>

                    <!-- Raman[cite: 1] -->
                    <div class="team-row">
                        <div class="team-photo">
                            <img src="Raman.jpg" alt="Raman">
                        </div>
                        <div class="team-info">
                            <h3>Raman</h3>
                            <span class="meta-label">Community Educator | Ground Operations</span>
                            <p>Founder of LIFI. Anchors our ground strategy across 17 NCR kilns (Hindi-speaking, ages 8–14) and manages our network of community teachers[cite: 1].</p>
                        </div>
                    </div>

                    <!-- Diya[cite: 1] -->
                    <div class="team-row">
                        <div class="team-photo">
                            <img src="diya.jpg" alt="Diya">
                        </div>
                        <div class="team-info">
                            <h3>Diya</h3>
                            <span class="meta-label">Project Documentation</span>
                            <p>Owns the visual and structural documentation, ensuring the project's data and narrative are transparent, legible, and sustainable long after completion[cite: 1].</p>
                        </div>
                    </div>

                    <!-- Kip[cite: 1] -->
                    <div class="team-row">
                        <div class="team-photo">
                            <img src="kip.png" alt="Kip">
                        </div>
                        <div class="team-info">
                            <h3>Kip</h3>
                            <span class="meta-label">Program Guide</span>
                            <p>Steers our overall program navigation, bringing essential energy and strategic warmth to the cohort[cite: 1].</p>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </section>
        </article>

        <!-- VIEW: FIELD LOG & HUB -->
        <article id="fieldlog" class="view-section">
            <section class="section-padding container reveal">
                <div class="text-center-wrap" style="margin-bottom: 4rem;">
                    <span class="meta-label">Mission Control</span>
                    <h1>Project Hub & Field Logs.</h1>
                    <p>Live tracking of execution in the Sonipat district[cite: 1], upcoming meeting agendas, and digital data prototypes.</p>
                </div>
                
                <!-- STRING MAPPING VISUALIZATION INTERFACE -->
                <div class="agenda-block reveal" style="margin-bottom: 4rem; padding: 0;">
                    <div style="padding: 2rem; border-bottom: 2px solid var(--border-heavy); background: #FFF;">
                        <span class="status-tag tag-data">Data Prototype</span>
                        <h3>String-Mapping: Digital Translation Canvas</h3>
                        <p style="margin-bottom: 0;">Visualizing the analog thread-mapping and petroleum jelly cards[cite: 1] collected from the 17 brick kilns[cite: 1]. Hover over nodes to view simulated ground metrics.</p>
                    </div>
                    
                    <div class="data-canvas-wrapper">
                        <svg class="svg-canvas" viewBox="0 0 1000 500" preserveAspectRatio="none">
                            <path d="M 200 150 Q 400 50 600 200 T 800 350" class="string-path" />
                            <path d="M 200 150 Q 300 300 500 400 T 800 350" class="string-path" />
                            <path d="M 600 200 L 500 400" class="string-hazard" />
                        </svg>
                        <div class="map-node" style="top: 142px; left: 192px;" data-info="Kiln Alpha: Start Point"></div>
                        <div class="map-node" style="top: 192px; left: 592px; background: var(--accent-red);" data-info="Live Wire Hazard Detected"></div>
                        <div class="map-node" style="top: 392px; left: 492px;" data-info="High Dust Density (Jelly Card A2)"></div>
                        <div class="map-node" style="top: 342px; left: 792px;" data-info="Kiln Beta: High Foot Traffic"></div>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <!-- MEETING AGENDAS -->
                <h3 style="margin-top: 5rem; border-bottom: 2px solid var(--border-heavy); padding-bottom: 1rem;">Active Discussions & Next Steps</h3>
                <div class="agenda-list reveal">
                    
                    <div class="agenda-block">
                        <div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: flex-start;">
                            <div>
                                <span class="status-tag tag-execution">Execution Block</span>
                                <h3>Toolkit Deployment Friction</h3>
                                <p style="margin: 0; font-size: 0.95rem;">Sonipat, NCR - Raman's Team[cite: 1]</p>
                            </div>
                            <span class="meta-label">Upcoming Zoom</span>
                        </div>
                        
                        <details>
                            <summary>View Agenda, Outcomes & Tasks</summary>
                            <div class="agenda-content">
                                <ul>
                                    <li><strong>Context:</strong> Distributed first batch of petroleum jelly cards to 50 children[cite: 1]. Friction in explaining mechanics vs instruction.</li>
                                    <li><strong>Agenda:</strong> How do we simplify the language to focus purely on visual outcomes?</li>
                                    <li><strong>Next Steps:</strong> Vivek to adapt the curriculum script by Tuesday. Priya to review environmental factors.</li>
                                </ul>
                                <button class="btn" style="padding: 0.5rem 1rem; font-size: 0.7rem; margin-top: 1rem;">Link to Zoom Recording</button>
                            </div>
                        </details>
                    </div>

                    <div class="agenda-block">
                        <div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: flex-start;">
                            <div>
                                <span class="status-tag tag-ideation">Ideation Phase</span>
                                <h3>Economic Context Integration</h3>
                                <p style="margin: 0; font-size: 0.95rem;">Bridging the gap between hazard mapping and economic impact.</p>
                            </div>
                            <span class="meta-label">Completed Sync</span>
                        </div>
                        
                        <details>
                            <summary>View Notes</summary>
                            <div class="agenda-content">
